OL,3,GNEWSAGolders Green rabbi guilty of
OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA strictly Orthodox rabbi has been
OL,7,Ffound guilty of sexually assaulting a
OL,8,Fwoman who came to him for religious
OL,9,Fadvice at his home in north London.
OL,11,FAaron Halpern, known as Rabbi Chaim
OL,12,FHalpern, denied sexually touching the
OL,13,Fwoman during a meeting in June 2022 at
OL,14,Fthe premises above his synagogue in
OL,15,FGolders Green.
OL,17,FThe 68-year-old was tried at Harrow
OL,18,FCrown Court, where jurors who
OL,19,Fdeliberated for over 10 hours heard the
OL,20,Fwoman had been experiencing mental
OL,21,Fhealth difficulties when she sought his
OL,22,Fadvice.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
